          "Pista 1: Reemplace $s = j\\omega \\implies s^2 = (j\\omega)^2 = -\\omega^2$.",
          "Pista 2: $Z(j\\omega) = \\frac{1}{-\\omega^2 D} = -\\frac{1}{\\omega^2 D}$.",
          "Pista 3: $\\omega^2 = 10^8$. $\\omega^2 D = 10^8 \\times 10^{-10} = 10^{-2} = 0.01$. Luego $-1 / 0.01 = -100\\,\\Omega$."
