        "explicacionPaso": "Para $s = j\\omega$:\\n$Z(j\\omega) = \\frac{1}{(j\\omega)^2 D} = -\\frac{1}{\\omega^2 D} = -\\frac{1}{(10000)^2 \\times 10^{-10}} = -\\frac{1}{10^8 \\times 10^{-10}} = -\\frac{1}{0.01} = -100.0\\,\\Omega$."
